### Create Ticket
POST http://localhost:3000/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Refund Request",
  "description": "Customer is asking for a refund",
  "customerEmail": "test@example.com",
  "priority": "normal"
}

### Check Reply
POST http://localhost:3000/replies/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketId": "tkt_f3a166a9",
  "draft": "We apologize for the delay. We will issue a full refund immediately."
}